In center Victor-Gadbois the days pass without ever being the same.
Next to a 94-year-old man savoring his last family reunion in the yard, well placed between his pillows while everyone drinks to his health, a 36-year-old tragically dies, surrounded by his parents, his wife and two children, after having tried everything to survive.
